flowchart TD
  A[count in-degree of every node] --> B[queue all nodes with in-degree 0]
  B --> C{queue empty?}
  C -->|no| D[pop node, add to order]
  D --> E[for each neighbour: in-degree -= 1]
  E --> F{in-degree is 0?}
  F -->|yes| G[push to queue]
  F -->|no| C
  G --> C
  C -->|yes| H{order has all nodes?}
  H -->|yes| I[valid order]
  H -->|no| J[cycle: impossible]
